OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CPolice investigate unknown substance   
OL,5,Cthat caused Manchester's Co-op Live    
OL,6,Cevacuation                             
OL,7,GPolice are investigating after         
OL,8,Gthousands of people were evacuated     
OL,9,Gfrom a concert in Manchester following 
OL,10,Gan "unknown substance" being released  
OL,11,Ginto the crowd.                        
OL,13,FIt happened towards the end of US      
OL,14,Frapper Don Toliver's show at the Co-op 
OL,15,FLive arena at about 22:00 GMT on       
OL,16,FSunday, with fans describing a         
OL,17,F"horrible smell" and people            
OL,18,F"screaming" and "coughing up blood".   
